270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One day exposure visit was organized for the farmers at District Horticulture Farm Byrnihat. The exposure visit was organized on 28th April 2023.The main objective of the exposure was to give practical exposure to farmers and the farmers learnt from different successful implementation models being implemented particularly on black pepper cultivation in this region. Farmers from two villages \(Nongspung-A and Timbokgre\) along with MSW interns from Assam Don Bosco University \(ADBU\) Sonapur were participated during the exposure visit. Farmers were taken to different units wherethey got to witnessed first hand knowledge on Propagating of black pepper. Farmers were happy and encourage by seeing the different unit. A total of 17 participants took part in the exposure visit.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
