/ActualText (Capacity Building Training on Promotion of Livestock Rearing, Focused on Piggery The training is conducted in collaboration with the Office of the Assistant Director, Vocational Training Centre, Kyrdemkulai, Animal Husbandry & Veterinary Department, Government of Meghalaya at Umtyrnga Village, Umling Block, Ri-Bhoi District, Meghalaya. The main objective of the training is to impart knowledge on pig rearing activities for enhancing household income of women belonging to low-income households and members of SHGs from 10 villages which are under the project. )
