291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The training aimed to improve the livelihoods of marginalized women in 10 tribal villages of Umling Block, Ri-Bhoi District, Meghalaya, by teaching them to rear eri-silkworms and process eri-silk. Targeting daily wage earners and marginal farmers, many participants were already producing 15 to 20 kgs of cocoons annually but lacked skills in yarn processing. The training, conducted in 4 batches with 37 women, included theoretical sessions by Textile Department inspectors and practical workshops led by experts from Resham Sutra. This initiative addresses local yarn shortages and empowers women with necessary skills for product value addition.)
/E (The training aimed to improve the livelihoods of marginalized women in 10 tribal villages of Umling Block, Ri-Bhoi District, Meghalaya, by teaching them to rear eri-silkworms and process eri-silk. Targeting daily wage earners and marginal farmers, many participants were already producing 15 to 20 kgs of cocoons annually but lacked skills in yarn processing. The training, conducted in 4 batches with 37 women, included theoretical sessions by Textile Department inspectors and practical workshops led by experts from Resham Sutra. This initiative addresses local yarn shortages and empowers women with necessary skills for product value addition.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
