/ActualText (Energy for Health is one of the important areas MOSONiE has initiated in collaboration with SELCO Foundation. The whole Health Centres in Meghalaya has been solarised in order to run the overall health system functioning for 24 hrs without any lighting issues. MOSONiE initiated in monitoring the health centres by creating awareness in all the health centres and community level. The main aim of creating awareness is to make the rural people aware of the availability of facilities in the health centers, so that the villagers can avail 24X7 for any emergency purpose. )
