/ActualText (From 8th -12th August 2023, Project team Lian and Margaret attended a workshop on Project development and management at IDeA-the ant office at Chirang, Assam. The workshop on Project Development & Management aims to delve into the holistic process of project conceptualization, involving community engagement, logical framework preparation, budgeting, timeline establishment, project progress tracking, and more. This residential workshop spans five days and employs a combination of theoretical and practical facilitation techniques.)
