/S /H1
/T (Training On proposal writing and Formulation: From August 9th to 11th, 2023, MTeam Ringbila and Salome attended a training program on proposal writing and formulation, organized by the Northeast RCRC. The training took place at Manas Resort in Barpeta, Assam, and was attended by 33 participants. The resource persons for the program were Mr. Pratap and Mr. Kashi Mettya from National RCRC, Delhi. The main focus of the training was to assist grassroots organizations in building strong project proposals aligned with their thematic areas. The sessions were insightful, providing valuable knowledge and skills to help organizations approach funders effectively and ensure organizational sustainability.)
/E (Training On proposal writing and Formulation: From August 9th to 11th, 2023, MTeam Ringbila and Salome attended a training program on proposal writing and formulation, organized by the Northeast RCRC. The training took place at Manas Resort in Barpeta, Assam, and was attended by 33 participants. The resource persons for the program were Mr. Pratap and Mr. Kashi Mettya from National RCRC, Delhi. The main focus of the training was to assist grassroots organizations in building strong project proposals aligned with their thematic areas. The sessions were insightful, providing valuable knowledge and skills to help organizations approach funders effectively and ensure organizational sustainability.)
/Alt ()
