/T (Livelihood Promotion: From 13th - 16th September 2023 MTeam, Lian and Salome attended a workshop on Livelihood promotion organized by IDeA-the ant at Bosco Reachout Guwahati. The workshop specifically emphasizes the development of resilient livelihood practices, drawing from both traditional and contemporary approaches, within the North-eastern states. Over the course of four days, participants will engage in a combination of theoretical and practical exercises, further enhancing their comprehension of value chains and business planning. The ultimate goal of the workshop is to foster a harmonious integration of market-oriented strategies and sustainable management of natural resources.)
