/T (South Asia Forum for Distributed Energy : On 24th August 2023 Margaret participated in the South Asia Forum for Distributed Energy. The event was organized by GOGLA in collaboration with SELCO Foundation. she highlighted the positive impact of Decentralized Renewable Energy on communities in remote areas. She also highlighted the challenges faced by the team to provide financial services due to the geographical terrain. Taking MOSONiE-SEF as an example she shared the importance of supporting these underserved communities and empowering through access to energy. )
