/S /H1
/T (Distributed Renewable Energy \(DRE\) for Livelihood in the Northeast Region \(NER\) : On September 22, 2023 MNRE, along with SELCO Foundation and AREAS, organized a workshop focused on developing program pipelines for Distributed Renewable Energy \(DRE\) for livelihoods in the North East Region \(NER\). The Executive Director of MOSONiE SEF gave the opening statement at the workshop, held at AIC-SELCO Foundation in Guwahati, Assam. She discussed the region's challenging geographical terrain, the financial model for DRE interventions, and their impact. Additionally, she stressed the significance of partnerships with government institutions and the effective utilization of funds for implementation.)
/E (Distributed Renewable Energy \(DRE\) for Livelihood in the Northeast Region \(NER\) : On September 22, 2023 MNRE, along with SELCO Foundation and AREAS, organized a workshop focused on developing program pipelines for Distributed Renewable Energy \(DRE\) for livelihoods in the North East Region \(NER\). The Executive Director of MOSONiE SEF gave the opening statement at the workshop, held at AIC-SELCO Foundation in Guwahati, Assam. She discussed the region's challenging geographical terrain, the financial model for DRE interventions, and their impact. Additionally, she stressed the significance of partnerships with government institutions and the effective utilization of funds for implementation.)
