/T (Accounting and financial management Workshop: MOSONiE SEF team attended a 3-days workshop from the 9th to 11th of October 2023 on Accounts and Financial Management organized by IDeA the Ant. The Training enhanced the team with new insights and concepts on accounting and record keeping systems such as books of accounts to be maintained, basic accounting documents, details of register to be maintained, cash management and bank management. The team learned about the statutory requirements of non profit Organizations like MOSONiE SEF. The team also got a fair idea of how to make budgets and how to manage budgets of various projects and inputs on basics of accounting softwares primarily tally prime.)
