/T (Team Exposure visit  From 19th to 21st February 2024, project team went for capacity building and exposure on livelihood to SeSTA Office, Guwahati. The aim of the visit was to engage in insightful interactions and gain a deeper understanding of the organization's various functions and intervention models, particularly focusing on livelihood interventions. The team had the opportunity to interact with professionals from SeSTA and communities which allowed the team to witness firsthand field approaches, processes and staff engagement of day-to-day activities at Rongjuli Goalpara Dist, Assam. )
