/T (Northeast Health Summit  On 28th February 2024, Executive Director of MOSONiE-SEF participated in the Energy for Health Summit Northeast Region Chapter 2024. The penal discussion focused on Leveraging Financial resources. During the penal she shared her firsthand experiences working in healthcare at the grassroots level. She emphasized the importance of close monitoring of solar infrastructure at health centers and the need to reduce transaction cost for healthcare facilities. she highlighted the challenges faced in the hilly terrains where road accessibility is severely affected by rain. Strengthening the health sector infrastructure requires ongoing financial support and she discussed MOSONiE efforts to develop an operation and Maintenance model in Ri-Bhoi District, Meghalaya. )
/E (Northeast Health Summit  On 28th February 2024, Executive Director of MOSONiE-SEF participated in the Energy for Health Summit Northeast Region Chapter 2024. The penal discussion focused on Leveraging Financial resources. During the penal she shared her firsthand experiences working in healthcare at the grassroots level. She emphasized the importance of close monitoring of solar infrastructure at health centers and the need to reduce transaction cost for healthcare facilities. she highlighted the challenges faced in the hilly terrains where road accessibility is severely affected by rain. Strengthening the health sector infrastructure requires ongoing financial support and she discussed MOSONiE efforts to develop an operation and Maintenance model in Ri-Bhoi District, Meghalaya. )
