/S /H1
/T (Building strong Foundation Nurturing Organisational Development & Culture in CSOS The session was taken up by Achintya Ghosh, Founder & Executive Director of KABIL and Michelle Markos COO at Sunbird Trust. The session talks about the organisation development from a different perspective. The speakers emphasized on recruitment, nurturing, capacity building, culture and values, System and process, building relationships with stakeholders, roles and responsibilities of the founding members, and regular team meetings for overall sustainability of the organisation.)
/E (Building strong Foundation Nurturing Organisational Development & Culture in CSOS The session was taken up by Achintya Ghosh, Founder & Executive Director of KABIL and Michelle Markos COO at Sunbird Trust. The session talks about the organisation development from a different perspective. The speakers emphasized on recruitment, nurturing, capacity building, culture and values, System and process, building relationships with stakeholders, roles and responsibilities of the founding members, and regular team meetings for overall sustainability of the organisation.)
